wg-unstuck-button = Unstick me
wg-unstuck-button-tooltip = If you are stuck inside a wall or other solid structure, moves you to the nearest clear floor. Inside a vehicle, puts you back outside it.
wg-unstuck-done = You squeeze free.
wg-unstuck-vehicle-done = You climb back out of the vehicle.
wg-unstuck-vehicle-locked = The vehicle is locked. If you are trapped inside, ask an admin for help.
wg-unstuck-vehicle-restrained = You can't get out like this.
wg-unstuck-vehicle-blocked = Every way out of the vehicle is blocked. Ask an admin for help.
wg-unstuck-not-stuck = You aren't stuck in anything. If you are trapped some other way, ask an admin for help.
wg-unstuck-no-room = There is no clear floor nearby. Ask an admin for help.
wg-unstuck-no-body = You have no body to free.
wg-unstuck-in-container = You are inside something. Try to climb out instead.
wg-unstuck-buckled = Unbuckle first.
wg-unstuck-cooldown = You can try again in { $seconds } { $seconds ->
    [one] second
   *[other] seconds
}.
